<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective May 3.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     23.55     24.85	  4.52-9.76  3.87-9.11</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     23.55     24.85	  4.33-9.33  3.70-8.68</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     26.90     26.90	 11.78	11.78</p>
<p> White sugar	  26.90     26.90	  7.26	 7.26</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.27	0.27	  0.38	 0.38</p>
</text>
